Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P3.2 start-mode env, stage pick log, auto door

DW3_START_MODE overrides post-newGame mode for logged field bring-up.
FIELDSTG_pickStage logs stage file; DW3_AUTO_DOOR_MODE requests a second
field mode after DW3_AUTO_DOOR_FRAMES (default 90). Avoid stdlib.h (game
atoi/random clash); declare getenv/strtol only.

